{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04255","headline":"送吴七游蜀 · 骆宾王","name":"送吴七游蜀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日观分齐壤，星桥接蜀门。\n桃花嘶别路，竹叶泻离樽。\n夏老兰犹茂，秋深柳尚繁。\n雾销山望迥，风高野听喧。\n劳歌徒欲奏，赠别竟无言。\n唯有当秋月，空照野人园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}